{"asset_key":"timeline/timeline_story_1601020414","episode":"timeline","category":"timeline_story","story_id":"1601020414","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1620707001:1":{"text":"莱纳斯……莱纳斯……","source_cn":"莱纳斯……莱纳斯……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x835E35B21C14286D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1620707002:1":{"text":"嘿！皮帕，你是在找我吗？我就在你旁边！","source_cn":"嘿！皮帕，你是在找我吗？我就在你旁边！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65DF9A80E3FE0AAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1620707003:1":{"text":"对对对对不起！我刚才没有看到你！","source_cn":"对对对对不起！我刚才没有看到你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE258A3E04F9AFB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1620707004:1":{"text":"梅林大人也在呢！<male>他</male><female>她</female>刚刚还体验了你发明的混沌魔法！","source_cn":"梅林大人也在呢！<male>他</male><fema...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x11A41F7C95FA372E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"梅林大人也在呢！<male>他</male><female>她</female>刚刚还体验了你发明的混沌魔法！","female":"梅林大人也在呢！<male>他</male><female>她</female>刚刚还体验了你发明的混沌魔法！","variant_male_record_index":"202306","variant_female_record_index":"202307","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1620707005:1":{"text":"说起来还要感谢你教会了我用它，太了不起了！我已经迫不及待让更多人体验到它的乐趣了！","source_cn":"说起来还要感谢你教会了我用它，太了不起了！我已经迫不及...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD25C2C91C1575C66","varian